      "mergeID": "616257ff2850da0bfce55902",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Can we get option (can be in json config file) to disable grouping of pictures? Separation only adds work to go thro pictures, and if i want pictures from given time i can just use windows search.  \n(I have 13.5k pictures currently)\nIf anything then adding stuff like world name to pictures name or metadata would be much more easier for organising and searching.",
