      "mergeID": "63e5139b943f18502980489e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "For a while now, vrchat has used the file path: \"thisPC > pictures > vrchat > month\" for photos taken in vrc. But recently they changed it to: \"disk > vrchat > month\". It would be nice if you could manually choose a file path that you want, whether it be the old path (what I want to do), or a completely different place on your computer.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Photo file path customization",
